<title>POLAND: RAFAKO SWINGS TO PROFIT IN 1996.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO SWINGS TO PROFIT IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.63 vs  74.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.63 vs  83.99</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.66 vs  83.75 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   21.94 vs  26.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.00 vs  56.45 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.00 vs  54.54 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit    25.56 vs  45.01 loss</p>
<p> Sales		  367.48 vs 359.23</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial boilermaker is</p>
<p>Raciborskie Fabryki Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
